    {
      "object_id": "mathia_synthesis_cbcdbbe73afde413fd965a8ff4f8c47c6bb4c92537a2303d886df6c06cd5dabe",
      "object_role": "synthesis",
      "proposed_content": "The source develops one representation pipeline: it back-designs an x^4+n^2 residue kernel to manufacture the alternating-series terms while preserving a summable n-dependence, eliminates n to obtain Eq. (2.6), complexifies the auxiliary parameter and changes variables to obtain the strip-form Eq. (2.8), then expands the hyperbolic subtraction into moments that yield the Gamma-weighted shifted-zeta series and its baseline-separated refinement.",
